  (text "Allocation: the 64-pad map (proposed-comms-pinout.csv). Link to flight: USART3, PC10 TX / PC11 RX, AF7.\nADC_ labels are scaled physical inputs, never raw battery rails.\nVCAP pins share their own node; never tied to 3.3 V.\nVBAT is the backup-domain pin, supplied by this MCU domain.\nSWD and oscillator nets are distinct for each processor."
    (at 248.92 68.58 0)
    (effects
