  (text "What this does: Handles radio, GNSS and USB service so those tasks cannot monopolise the flight MCU.\nConnects to: UART link to flight: 04b. USB: 04c. GNSS: 04d. Radio: 04e/04f. Local supplies/clocks: 04a; reset/debug: 02comms-reset-debug."
